 "remarks": "Sun-drenched and full of character, this distinctive loft-style residence features a desirable southern exposure, hardwood floors, exposed brick and stainless-steel appliances.  Unlike many open SoNo lofts, Unit 2-H offers a separate bedroom area divided from the main living space by a wall-a rare feature that provides added privacy while preserving the home's open, airy character.  The comfortable layout works equally well for relaxing, entertaining or working from home. Located on the second floor of a walk-up building, the residence includes another major downtown advantage: one garage parking space is included in the rent.  Step outside and enjoy restaurants, cafes, nightlife, shopping, the waterfront and the South Norwalk train station-all within easy reach.  This is more than an apartment-it is an opportunity to enjoy the character, energy and walkable lifestyle of Washington Street.  Highlights:  $2,400 per month Separate bedroom area-a rare SoNo loft feature Sun-drenched southern exposure Hardwood floors Exposed brick Stainless-steel appliances Second-floor walk-up One garage parking space included Walk to restaurants, cafes, nightlife, the train and waterfront  Park the car. Drop the keys. Walk to dinner. Welcome to SoNo.",
